@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
title Жизненный цикл задачи и checkpoints

[*] --> pending : /harness-feature | /harness-bug
pending --> in_progress : /harness-run T-XXX\nпроверки пройдены
in_progress --> awaiting_review : CHECKPOINT CP-N reached\ncheckpoint + snapshot commit
awaiting_review --> in_progress : approved\n(intermediate checkpoint)
awaiting_review --> in_progress : changes_requested\n(return to same checkpoint)
awaiting_review --> done : CP-F approved\nacceptance + final commit
awaiting_review --> failed : user reject
in_progress --> failed : acceptance failure
failed --> in_progress : fix and retry\n(max 3 attempts per chunk)
in_progress --> blocked : external blocker /\n3 failed attempts
blocked --> in_progress : blocker resolved
done --> [*]

note right of awaiting_review
  Без явного approved задача
  остаётся awaiting_review.
  Правки пользователя authoritative.
end note

note bottom of in_progress
  Одна активная задача across feature+bugfix.
  Feature и bugfix не параллельны.
end note
@enduml
